GPG signing key (used for git commits, release tags, advisories):

        4491 8A01 3087 BBF8 4D41  C229 4FD9 DE40 1BD9 C40C

To verify a signed commit:

        git log --show-signature

Imports of the public key are available from the usual public
keyservers (keys.openpgp.org, keyserver.ubuntu.com).  When in doubt,
fetch by fingerprint, not by email.

================================================================
attribution policy
================================================================

Every artifact in this repository, code, comments, commit messages,
documentation, error strings, configuration files, is authored by the
maintainer.  No file references generative tooling, vendor names
behind such tooling, or any "generated", "co-authored", or "with help
from" attribution phrasing.  The forbidden-token list is enforced by
the repository's pre-commit attribution scan.

If you contribute a patch, sign your work under the
Developer Certificate of Origin (DCO) by adding a Signed-off-by line
to your commit.  See docs/CONTRIBUTING.md for the full process.

